<!doctype html><html lang="en-IN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Free Age Calculator. Calculate age in years, months and days from date of birth to today or another date."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://sehdevverma.github.io/free-tool-hub/tools/age-calculator.html"><meta name="google-adsense-account" content="ca-pub-5821164202370457"><script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5821164202370457" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><title>Age Calculator – Calculate Age from Date of Birth | FreeToolHub</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/style.css"></head><body><header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="../index.html">FreeTool<span>Hub</span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" onclick="document.querySelector('.nav nav').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button><nav><a href="../index.html#tools">Tools</a><a href="../about.html">About</a><a href="../privacy.html">Privacy</a></nav></div></header><main class="tool-page"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="../index.html">Home</a> / Age Calculator</div><div class="tool-wrapper"><div class="tool-box"><h1>Age Calculator</h1><p>Enter your date of birth to calculate your exact age in years, months and days.</p><div class="form-group"><label for="dob">Date of Birth</label><input id="dob" type="date"></div><button class="btn" onclick="calcAge()">Calculate Age</button><div id="out" class="result" hidden></div></div><div class="ad-slot"><ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block" data-ad-client="ca-pub-5821164202370457" data-ad-format="auto" data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins><script>(adsbygoogle=window.adsbygoogle||[]).push({});</script></div><div class="content"><h2>How the age calculator works</h2><p>Select your date of birth and the calculator compares it with today’s date. The result is shown as completed years, months and days.</p><h2>Age calculation example</h2><p>If someone was born on 15 January 2000, the result depends on the exact date on which the calculation is performed.</p></div></div></div></main><footer><div class="wrap"><p><a href="../index.html">FreeToolHub</a> · <a href="../privacy.html">Privacy</a></p></div></footer><script>function calcAge(){let s=document.getElementById('dob').value;if(!s)return;let b=new Date(s+'T00:00:00'),t=new Date();t.setHours(0,0,0,0);if(b>t){alert('Date of birth cannot be in the future.');return}let y=t.getFullYear()-b.getFullYear(),m=t.getMonth()-b.getMonth(),d=t.getDate()-b.getDate();if(d<0){m--;d+=new Date(t.getFullYear(),t.getMonth(),0).getDate()}if(m<0){y--;m+=12}let o=document.getElementById('out');o.hidden=false;o.innerHTML='<strong>Age: '+y+' years, '+m+' months, '+d+' days</strong>'}</script></body></html>
